The police sector needs to manage the means of transport including: cars,motorbikes, trucks. Each category includes information: vehicle number,manufacturer, year of manufacture, vehicle color and vehicle owner. In there:– Cars manage more attributes: number of seats, engine type.– Motorcycles manage more attributes: capacity.– Trucks manage more attributes: tonnage.– Vehicle owners manage information: cmnd number, full name, email.With your OOP knowledge learned, write a program in the Java programminglanguage that fulfills the following requirements:
Requirement 1: Build classes to manage the above facilities effectively.
Requirement 2: The program performs the following tasks:1. More means of transport2. Search for transport by vehicle number3. Find the vehicle owner's vehicle with the corresponding cmnd number.4. Delete all vehicles of any manufacturer.5. Indicate which manufacturer has the most vehicles under management6. Sort vehicles by number of vehicles in descending order7. Statistics of each vehicle type, how many vehicles are being managed.Some of the rules of the program are as follows:– Each car has a unique car number that does not match and has exactly 5 characters– Manufacturers only include: Honda, Yamaha, Toyota, Suzuki– The year of manufacture must be less than or equal to the current year and greater than 2000.– The ID number must be exactly 12 numbers and each car owner has a unique identity card number.Email must be in the correct format
